{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c43ebe9885cfe40e","name":"Gamorrean Warlord","source":{"id":"source:reference-c43ebe9885cfe40e","title":"Gamorrean Warlord","revision":21592,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:06:03Z","sha256":"901bdf81e90ada3127395116b939ae67a73b1a4c211d78b667e97f15742e2c15","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21592","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gamorrean%20Warlord&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c43ebe9885cfe40e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["A Wretched Hive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A_Wretched_Hive","referenceId":"reference:499e9f32005279b4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["An uncharacteristic intelligence shines in this Gamorrean's eyes, though he seems to be just as savage as the other guards. Adorned in elaborate battle armor that appears to be custom made to fit his stout figure, this warrior has a commanding presence that seems to cause the other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorreans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorreans"}," to fall into line."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Originally a clan chief on his homeworld of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorr","referenceId":"reference:2267314e8963e4ee"},", the Gamorrean Warlord is the commander of Darga's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorrean"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorrean","referenceId":"reference:50af9972d0387fe6"}," security force. Though less formidable in straight-up combat than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorrean Bashers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorrean_Bashers"},", the Gamorrean Warlord knows not only how to get the best out of his allies, but also how to keep them in the fight. The Gamorrean Warlord is a commander of soldiers and treats the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorreans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorreans"}," in Darga's service like his own private army. Though Darga has had to warn him in the past about getting too ambitious, the Warlord's resolve to defeat any threat to his new clan's dominance ensures that the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," always has a dangerous security force at his disposal. The Gamorrean Warlord has been so successful in whipping his comrades into shape that other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"}," have secretly tried to lure him away from Darga with promises of power and glory.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Gamorrean Warlord Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gamorrean"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gamorrean","referenceId":"reference:50af9972d0387fe6"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 1/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"t